                                        {{ alCost.total_pm }} Porsi (PK:
                                        {{ alCost.pm_pk }}, PB:
                                        {{ alCost.pm_pb }}) • Termasuk
                                        penyesuaian substitusi & eliminasi
                                    </span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="overflow-x-auto">
                                    <table
                                        class="w-full text-left text-xs border-collapse"
